# HackMate AI — Database Design & Flow Reference

This document provides a condensed reference for the HackMate AI database schema (Neon PostgreSQL).

---

## 1. Table Registry & Purposes

### Directory & Identity
*   **`universities`**: Stores participating universities and email domain constraints (e.g., `stanford.edu`).
*   **`departments`**: Stores study categories under each university (e.g., *Computer Science*).
*   **`users`**: Central profiles table containing hashed passwords, skill lists, and gamified experience points (XP).
*   **`roles`**: Defines platform access groups (e.g. *Student, Mentor, Faculty, Admin*).
*   **`user_roles_join`**: Bridge table mapping users to their system roles.
*   **`sessions`**: Tracks active login tokens (JWT refresh tokens) for security.
*   **`settings`**: Persists UI configuration selections (e.g. *dark/light theme, notification email toggles*).

### Hackathons & Team Workspaces
*   **`hackathons`**: Core events schedule, countdown targets, categories, and sponsor logs.
*   **`teams`**: Team workspaces, tracking project health and task completion percentages.
*   **`team_members`**: Bridge table mapping team rosters, indicating specific developer/designer roles.
*   **`team_invitations`**: Logs outreach invitations sent to student emails.

### Problem & Solution Lab
*   **`problem_statements`**: The core problem statement defined by a team (restricted to one per team).
*   **`pain_points`**: Context pain points logged under the problem statement.
*   **`solution_concepts`**: Pitched product ideas with pros, cons, and rating aggregates.
*   **`idea_votes`**: Ratings (1-5 stars) and comments submitted on pitched ideas.

### Discussions & Chat
*   **`discussion_channels`**: Chat rooms (e.g. `#general`, `#frontend`) inside team workspaces.
*   **`messages`**: Log of chat messages and emoji reaction states.

### Task Board (Kanban)
*   **`tasks`**: Kanban task cards tracking status (`todo`, `in_progress`, `completed`), priority, and deadlines.
*   **`task_assignments`**: Bridge table mapping tasks to assigned team members.
*   **`task_comments`**: Workspace discussions logged under individual tasks.

### Files & Notes Storage
*   **`documents`**: Folders and note file titles in the project workspace tree.
*   **`document_versions`**: Text contents and edit history (markdown) for note files.
*   **`meeting_notes`**: Markdown summaries of team sync meetings.
*   **`architecture_files`**: SVG file strings showing system design blueprints.
*   **`presentations`**: Slide deck file metadata (file size, version).
*   **`presentation_versions`**: Presentation slide file links pointing to cloud storage.

### Analytics, Reviews & Logs
*   **`notifications`**: User alert system logs (tracks read/unread states).
*   **`activity_logs`**: Team action logs (e.g. "Sophia Chen added task") feeding the live dashboard stream.
*   **`badges`** & **`badge_awards`**: Gamification badges and user milestones.
*   **`judge_reviews`**: Evaluations, scores (0-100), and rubrics submitted by faculty.
*   **`audit_logs`**: Logs administrative database changes (captures before-and-after JSON states).
*   **`archived_projects`**: Searchable archive of completed hackathon projects.
*   **`knowledge_hub_articles`**: Guides, rules, and guidelines.

